          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આજકાલ (ājkāl) is built from two taught words, āj, \"today\", and kāl, \"tomorrow, yesterday\", so it means about now."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
